==Battleground==
*1 [[Camelle]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Camelle]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 0.2 seconds<sup>6f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
