==Strategy==
The key to this stage is to bring tanky and powerful units, but not only slow hitters, as those might get in trouble when the Trolly Bloggers appear, possibly being knocked far enough for the Camelles to hit your base. [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]], ([[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed]]) [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]], ([[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed]]) [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]] and [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Sifu Cat]] all work well, but fast, less tanky units like [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]], [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Giraffe]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|A. Bahamut]] work well too. Unit level is very important, so nothing can save you if you challenge this stage too early.

